{"name":"Terrestrial","hex":"#276757","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Terrestrial","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An inhabitant of the planet Earth."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Terrestrial"}],"entries":[{"title":"Terrestrial animal","blocks":[{"text":"Terrestrial animals are animals that live predominantly or entirely on land, as compared with aquatic animals, who live predominantly or entirely in bodies of water; and semiaquatic animals, who inhabit coastal, riparian or wetland areas and rely on both aquatic and terrestrial habitats. While most insects are terrestrial, some groups, such as mosquitoes and dragonflies, spend their egg and larval stages in water but emerge as fully terrestrial adults (imagos) after completing metamorphosis."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ee/Capra_aegagrus_hircus%2C_Neuss_%28DE%29_--_2023_--_0027.jpg/330px-Capra_aegagrus_hircus%2C_Neuss_%28DE%29_--_2023_--_0027.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Terrestrial_animal"},{"title":"Terrestrial (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Terrestrial is 2025 thriller / dark comedy film directed by Steve Pink and written by Samuel Johnson and Connor Diedrich."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Terrestrial_(film)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ee/Capra_aegagrus_hircus%2C_Neuss_%28DE%29_--_2023_--_0027.jpg/500px-Capra_aegagrus_hircus%2C_Neuss_%28DE%29_--_2023_--_0027.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ee/Capra_aegagrus_hircus%2C_Neuss_%28DE%29_--_2023_--_0027.jpg/1280px-Capra_aegagrus_hircus%2C_Neuss_%28DE%29_--_2023_--_0027.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ee/Capra_aegagrus_hircus%2C_Neuss_%2